# =============================================================================
# autosave.ignore
#
# Definition of “files to exclude from automatic WIP backups” in .gitignore format.
# autosave.sh reads this as a `core.excludesFile`.
#
# Location: .devcontainer/autosave.ignore
#
# Note:
#   - This does not apply to tracked files (files already under Git control). It applies only to untracked files.
#   - Please add or remove entries as needed for your project.
#     (Example: If you place source files in `build/` or `dist/`, delete the corresponding lines.)
#   - This file can also be used as-is as a template for `.gitignore`.
# =============================================================================


# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Confidential Information and Environment Variables
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.env
!.env.example
!.env.sample
!.env.template
!*.env.example
.envrc
.dev.vars
.direnv/

